WEBVTT

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:18.340
koi ni naranai ne soba ni iru dake ja

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:18.340
Just being close to you doesn't make love happen.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:25.590
nazo wo kakete mo donkan na hito dakara

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:25.590
Even if I make a puzzle you can't solve it because you're slow

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:32.750
natsu no fuku wo kite haru no umi ni kita

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:32.750
We came to the spring sea, wearing summer clothes.

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:40.030
anata no SHATSU de yasashiku kabatte

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:40.030
Please cover me gently with your shirt.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.840
My heart iidasenai

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.840
My heart won't let me say

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:47.340
Please KISU shite tte

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:47.340
"Please kiss me."

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.670
Day Dream

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.670
Day Dream...

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:51.000
yume wa fukurami

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:51.000
My dream gets bigger

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:57.150
sora ni takaku kieru

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:57.150
and disappears high in the sky.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:05.520
onna no ko wa dare datte shiawase ni nareru

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:05.520
Any girl can be happy.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:12.330
koi ga hajimareba kagayakidasu

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:12.330
When they fall in love, they start shining.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:19.970
tatoe namida nagashite mo anata no sei nara

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:19.970
Even if the tears start flowing, or my heart aches,

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:27.410
mune wo itamete mo yashiku naru

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:27.410
if it's because of you, she'll become gentler

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.070
Keiichi-san...

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:06.450
Oh! Sorry!

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:09.420
Thank you.

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:13.770
We'll be ready to eat soon.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:15.850
No hurry.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:17.380
OK.

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:25.100
It's already been 5 months since Belldandy arrived.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.660
Hello!

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.740
Welcome!

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:34.160
Thank you for inviting me again today!

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:36.260
What do you mean "inviting you?"

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.700
You've been coming over here everyday lately!

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.300
What's wrong with that?

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.270
I'm pitching in for the food expenses, you know.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:45.740
Besides, I love Belldandy's cooking!

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:48.810
I'm happy that you like it.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:50.310
Please have a seat.

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.040
We'll be ready to eat soon.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.260
Thank you!

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.850
Sure is hot, eh?

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:57.320
Yeah.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.330
Here...

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:01.470
This came for you.

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:06.210
I wonder who it's from.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:08.690
It doesn't say.

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:10.110
Kei-chan...

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.910
Are you going anywhere this summer?

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.270
I don't have any money, you know.

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:17.140
What a sad summer vacation.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:17.870
Leave me alone!

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:20.110
Why don't you go to the ocean or something?

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:21.460
The ocean?

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:24.610
Oh, I forgot that you can't swim!

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:26.210
I know how to swim!

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.580
About 10 meters.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.120
You mean while sinking, right?

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.180
Thank you for waiting.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.140
Let's eat!

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.560
Thank you!

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.730
It was delicious!

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.270
Megumi, did you go anywhere this year?

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:46.790
Yup.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.800
Went to the ocean twice.

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:50.270
To the ocean?

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:50.970
That must be nice.

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:51.600
Thank you.

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:55.310
I've never been to the ocean.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:58.280
How unusual.

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:03.870
Say, why don't you ask Kei-chan to take you there?

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.590
To the ocean?

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:08.170
I would love to go.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.260
The ocean, eh.

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:14.760
I'm sure she'd like it if I took her there.

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:17.630
Belldandy!

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:19.360
Keiichi-san...

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:21.830
Belldandy...

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:24.170
Keiichi-san...

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:26.240
Belldandy...

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.280
Keiichi-san...

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:32.140
Belldandy...

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:32.650
All right!

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:33.280
I'll go for it!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.780
And, then I'll have a memorable summer experience!

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:40.150
At the very least, a kiss or something!

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:40.930
All right!

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:41.990
I'll do it!

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:43.960
Do what?

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:47.330
No, nothing, really!

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:50.860
Keiichi-san...

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:53.770
I'm going shopping now.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.760
OK.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:58.270
I'll be off now.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.540
Have a safe trip.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:10.940
Don't tell me it'll explode if I open it!

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:12.410
Yeah, right!

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:15.320
Why, this is...

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:18.960
Such a risque title...

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.280
it can only be something that one of my kind senpai would send me!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.930
While Belldandy's out...

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:42.640
Just a little, OK?

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.910
What the...?

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.820
Hi!

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:36.070
Nice to meet you.

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:36.870
Say...

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.400
you're going out to the ocean, right?

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:40.710
You're finally feeling up to it, eh?

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:46.460
I was wondering when you were gonna make a move on her!

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:50.830
Wh-Who're you?

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.750
I'm the Cupid of Love.

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:57.190
So, how're you going to make your move?

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:59.730
"Make my move?"
 I haven't...!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.970
That's not the way to go about it.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.550
Women, you see,

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:06.430
are in search of something stimulating.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.700
First, you touch her body,

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.730
there by the ocean.

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:15.940
At night, that's right...

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:18.340
be a man, okay?

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:21.080
When the two of you are all alone...

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.990
hold her tight, like this!

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:25.680
Then, go all the way!

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:28.070
W-Wait a sec!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.430
Why're you running away?

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:33.530
You two aren't getting anywhere because you act like that!

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:35.960
Are you really serious about her?

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.840
I am serious about her, but...

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:38.830
Listen to me.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:42.050
She's waiting for you to act!

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:45.270
She's longing for you, with her entire body!

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:46.340
Belldandy...

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:48.010
longing for me?

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:49.350
Hold on a second!

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:50.890
Who the heck are you?

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:54.910
How do you know so much about us anyway?

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:58.380
I know everything.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:07:59.920
I'm back!

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:02.670
She's back already.

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:05.460
At any rate, you take a shot at it, got that?

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:07.730
I'll back you up.

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:09.130
"Back me up?"

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:12.400
Oh, by the way, don't tell my sister that I was here.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:15.300
She can be vindictive, so if you get her angry, she'll get nasty on you.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:19.710
Besides, you'll be in hot water if she finds that videotape, right?

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:21.420
Sister?

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:24.310
Wait!

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:25.980
Are you really Belldandy's...

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.680
Ane Urd.

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.240
Onee-san?

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.680
<i>Her</i>!?

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:50.890
This is such a nice feeling!

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:55.710
This is a wonderful place, isn't it, Keiichi-san?

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:01.490
Yeah...

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:03.090
very beautiful.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:04.380
Yes...

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:06.660
it's very beautiful!

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.430
Keiichi-san,

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:11.320
would you like to go to the beach?

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.110
Sure.

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:13.890
Let's go!

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:20.770
First, maybe we can hold hands together or something!

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:24.240
And Belldandy will be in a swimsuit!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:27.440
Come here quick!

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.140
Guess who?

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:31.580
Th-This is...

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.950
Belldandy's being so daring!

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:36.150
I knew that the ocean would be great!

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.080
Belldandy!

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:44.440
O-Onee-san...

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:47.260
Hi!

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:48.660
I'm here to back you up!

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.470
Did you really come for that?

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:53.270
What do you mean by that?

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:54.330
I'm sorry.

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:54.810
Well?

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:55.930
What is your plan?

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:58.690
For the time being, I guess we'll be holding hands...

00:09:58.690 --> 00:09:59.540
Childish!

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:02.440
That won't do at all!

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:03.540
It's no good?

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.400
Obviously not!

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:07.610
Use this.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:09.170
What is it?

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:12.280
"Urd's Own" Sunscreen Oil.

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:14.290
You use this and rub her all over.

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:16.830
If you do that, she'll be all mellow-mellow!

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:20.600
Rub her all over?

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:24.300
I'm all mellow-mellow!

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.970
Mellow-mellow?

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.220
Go for it!

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:29.790
I'll be keeping an eye on you.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:31.840
Onee-san!

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:34.100
No, no.

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:35.460
Just call me Urd.

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:37.320
See ya!

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:39.480
Urd-san!

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:41.180
Oh, boy!

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:42.380
Keiichi-san!

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:44.250
There she is!

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:52.090
Belldandy!

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.490
Over here!

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:57.300
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:58.220
Not at all!

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:01.560
I just got here myself, actually.

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:03.470
Is this swimsuit...

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.740
all right?

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:07.550
I've never worn one before.

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:10.680
You look great in it.

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:13.980
I'm glad that you like it.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.260
You're beautiful.

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:19.130
Th-That's right.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:20.600
Belldandy?

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.020
Yes?

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:25.270
I have some sunscreen here...

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:26.760
would you like me to put it on you?

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:27.850
Sure.

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:29.530
What must I do?

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:33.000
First of all, why don't you lie facedown?

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.520
Sure.

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:38.720
Then...

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:40.830
I'll put it on you, OK?

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:55.760
Morisato-kun!

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:58.200
Long time no see.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.810
What a coincidence bumping into you at a place like this!

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:02.770
Mishima Sayoko!

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:06.230
And, to top it off, you're with a girl. Aren't you the stud!

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.940
Hello.

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:10.840
She's gorgeous!

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:13.810
This girl isn't to be taken lightly!

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.660
Have I seen you in school before?

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:19.580
She's an exchange student.

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:21.550
This is Mishima Sayoko-san.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.020
She goes to my school.

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:24.560
How do you do.

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.380
My name is Belldandy.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:28.160
Say, Belldandy...

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.290
would you like to hang out with us?

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:32.470
We're going out on a boat.

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:34.680
All right?

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:37.010
Won't you come with us for a while?

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:38.380
No!

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:39.600
The Ultimate Force is gonna...

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:46.860
Nothing's happening.

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:49.540
Toshiyuki, let's go.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:53.880
Well, then, Morisato-kun, see ya later.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:55.440
Belldandy, we'll see you too.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:01.850
Whatever happened to the Ultimate Force?

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:02.660
That's strange...

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:05.990
Maybe there's a system malfunction.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:07.660
I'll check it out later.

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.100
Sure.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:12.630
We-We had some uninvited guests, but let's pick up where we left off!

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:14.070
Sure!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.070
where did the oil go?

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:20.480
No way!

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:25.560
It was so close!

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:27.880
This calls for another plan!

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:36.860
It's cold!

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:38.380
Oh, Keiichi-san!

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.230
I'll get back at you!

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:42.710
It's cold!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.040
We've come pretty far offshore.

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:49.000
Looks like it.

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.340
Urd's Plan No.2:

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:53.110
"Hop into a boat and go offshore!"

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:56.710
I don't really get it, but Belldandy looks happy about it...

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.610
so what the heck!

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:00.860
By the way, what was wrong with the Ultimate Force?

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:04.950
Well, I tried making contact,

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:06.850
but Urd nee-san wasn't there, so...

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:08.840
Onee-san?

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:09.870
Yes.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:13.690
System maintenance is her job.

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:17.830
So I don't really know what's going on unless I ask her.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.030
I-Is that so?

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:21.550
Keiichi-san...

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:23.830
may I row with you?

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.580
Yeah, sure!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.540
Oh, be careful!

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:32.630
Belldandy!

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:39.220
Are you OK?

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:41.180
Yes.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.630
Thank goodness!

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:45.820
Why, this is...

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.590
This position is...

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.400
It's going well!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.030
Now it's all up to Keiichi.

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:56.840
I'm sorry.

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.740
Now, go for it...

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:01.950
Belldandy...

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.410
Keiichi-san?

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.120
I'm sorry!

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.170
Are you all right?

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:19.590
<i>Her</i> again!

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.550
Sayoko-san...

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:24.530
Belldandy, it's you.

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:26.170
Weren't you with Morisato?

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:28.430
Keiichi-san!

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:30.890
Help!

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:33.680
Keiichi-san!

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:36.630
Keiichi-san!

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:40.250
Belldandy!

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:06.370
I'm very sorry, Keiichi-san.

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:17.150
You're

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.850
despicable.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:22.050
Bringing someone who can't swim this far offshore!

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:25.190
You've got some nerve,
 calling yourself his girlfriend.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:28.370
I don't care if you're an exchange student or what,

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.690
but you're acting so immaturely towards him!

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:37.300
Morisato-kun probably thinks that you're a bother!

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.510
I'm no good.

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:51.350
Being all cheery by myself and all.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:57.490
Maybe I'm not supposed to be with Keiichi-san.

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:59.270
What does Keiichi...

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:02.160
think of me?

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:07.200
Why are you crying?

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.840
Keiichi-san.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:13.440
Thank goodness you've regained consciousness!

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.480
Oh, that's right.

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:17.210
I drowned, didn't I?

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:18.490
I'm sorry.

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:22.480
I didn't know you couldn't swim.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:23.610
And

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.430
if I...

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:28.620
stay with you, Keiichi-san...

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:30.560
Belldandy...

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:31.830
I'm sorry!

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.190
I'll go get you some ice.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.390
Belldandy...

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.540
I can't.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:44.110
I'm too scared to ask.

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:49.070
What's going on?

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:50.510
She's crying...

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:51.940
Is it because of me?

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:54.040
You got that right!

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:57.120
Urd-san!

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:59.820
How dare you make my sister cry?

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:03.140
And you goofed up all my plans!

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:06.790
Why is she with such a loser like you?

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:08.300
Leave me alone, please!

00:18:08.300 --> 00:18:09.530
Oh, yeah?

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.400
You're telling me that you won't listen to what I'm saying?

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:17.120
lf she gets disgusted with you, and ends up going back to the Heavens do not come crying to me!

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:19.310
The Heavens?

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.980
Do you have any idea why she was crying?

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:24.650
It's because

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:27.400
you don't have enough love for her!

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:31.200
You can't be serious!

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:33.390
I love Belldandy!

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:35.500
Then you have to tell her that.

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:42.260
But, it'll be bad if you goof up again, so...

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:45.130
I'll put you under a spell, one that I've saved for this moment!

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:46.360
A spell?

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:47.750
Yeah.

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:50.400
This is a Magic Potion.

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:53.070
If you drink it, your courage will increase a hundredfold!

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:55.470
You too can be a Warrior of Love!

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:56.680
A Warrior of Love?

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:57.350
That's right.

00:18:57.350 --> 00:18:58.870
Go for it!

00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:01.110
See ya.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.870
All right!

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:18.060
Even Shakespeare is said to have used a love potion.

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:19.830
Whomever you first see when you awake...

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:22.470
is the one you will truly fall in love with.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:25.420
Sounds like someone is here.

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:27.670
Is it Belldandy, I wonder?

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:29.610
Morisato-kun...

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:30.290
Hey!

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:31.840
Are you in there?

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:35.610
I wanted to apologize for what happened.

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:38.950
When I thought about it,
 I realized that I was to blame too.

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:40.020
I'm sorry.

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:44.290
What're you doing?

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:46.390
Why didn't you answer?

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:49.300
That was so mean of you to open the door like that!

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:49.300
Sayoko?

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:53.490
Hey, say something!

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:56.000
You're beautiful!

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:58.170
Beautiful!

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.230
W-Wait a sec!

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:01.570
What the heck am I saying?

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:03.140
Wh-What is it?

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:06.920
The bluebird I thought I'd never find is here!

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.050
W-Wait a sec!

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:11.880
How soft!

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:15.890
Will you knock it off?

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:18.290
Oh, such a wonderful fragrance!

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.300
Stop it!

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:20.300
I wanna stop it myseIf!

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.210
What's going on with you?

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:25.960
Morisato-kun, you're acting strange!

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:29.130
Like a roach lured by the Roach Motel,

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:28.780
Oh, no.

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:30.400
It's her again.

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:33.780
like a beetle lured by a high-voltage bugzapper that shines blue-white.

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:33.780
I give up!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:35.140
I care not about any danger!

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:38.110
Your lips are what I seek!

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:38.840
Urd-san!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:39.980
Help me!

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:42.180
If Belldandy sees me like this-

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:43.280
Stop it!

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:46.760
You have Belldandy, don't you?

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:48.890
Belldandy?

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.120
You're wrong.

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:53.680
<i>You</i> are the one that I want near me.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:06.960
You're the reason that I'm here.

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:12.110
But if it's not what you desire...

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:14.550
then, I...

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:15.580
No!

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:17.880
That's not it, Belldandy!

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:18.670
Hold on!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:19.630
It's a misunderstanding!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.790
I only came here to apologize!

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:23.820
I'm sorry.

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:25.290
I don't want to hear it right now.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:28.460
Honestly there's nothing between us!

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:30.260
Belldandy! Can't you notice it?

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:31.110
You're mistaken...

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:32.230
Belldandy!

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:33.100
You're mistaken!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:35.760
Mistaken!

00:21:50.550 --> 00:21:51.840
Keiichi-san?

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:11.440
Keiichi-san!

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:12.450
Stop!

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:14.440
Please stop!

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:20.410
I'll go back home,

00:22:20.410 --> 00:22:23.550
if you think that I'm a bother.

00:22:23.550 --> 00:22:25.520
I'll go back home.

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:26.890
So...

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:29.850
please, pull yourself together!

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:35.560
Are you in pain?

00:22:40.820 --> 00:22:42.740
Keiichi-san...

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:48.790
Why, that's...

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:51.250
Nee-san!

00:22:51.730 --> 00:22:53.590
I know that you're here!

00:22:58.020 --> 00:22:58.930
Long time no see!

00:22:59.510 --> 00:23:01.910
No wonder things seemed strange.

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:03.140
This was all your doing, wasn't it?

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:05.860
Well, I guess you're on to me.

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:07.890
What did you do to Keiichi-san?

00:23:07.890 --> 00:23:09.960
Just gave him a little potion,

00:23:09.960 --> 00:23:12.610
cause I couldn't stand watching you two.

00:23:12.840 --> 00:23:15.070
Return Keiichi-san to normal!

00:23:15.070 --> 00:23:16.240
No way.

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:20.530
Such a shameful fool as he ought to stay like that.

00:23:20.840 --> 00:23:22.970
What did you just say?

00:23:22.970 --> 00:23:25.540
Even if you're my nee-san, I can't forgive you that!

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:31.330
Hey, don't get so serious!

00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:34.150
Change Keiichi-san back to the way he was!

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:35.250
But...

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:38.760
I never guessed that this would happen, so...

00:23:39.340 --> 00:23:40.910
Don't tell me...

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:42.930
that there's no cure for it?

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:44.680
Sorry.

00:23:45.140 --> 00:23:46.560
No!

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:51.520
Keiichi-san!

00:23:52.440 --> 00:23:54.020
Please!

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:56.980
Return to the way you were!

00:23:58.600 --> 00:24:01.550
I'm even willing to lose my divine powers,

00:24:01.550 --> 00:24:04.980
if that's what it takes to bring you back to normal!

00:24:04.980 --> 00:24:07.450
Please, Keiichi-san!

00:24:07.450 --> 00:24:08.660
Change back to normal...

00:24:23.180 --> 00:24:24.800
Belldandy.

00:24:24.800 --> 00:24:26.240
Keiichi-san.

00:24:28.430 --> 00:24:29.640
I'm back to normal!

00:24:29.920 --> 00:24:31.370
Keiichi-san,

00:24:31.370 --> 00:24:32.920
you're back to normal again!

00:24:33.300 --> 00:24:34.360
Yeah.

00:24:35.580 --> 00:24:37.040
I'm sorry.

00:24:37.040 --> 00:24:38.880
It was all Urd nee-san's doing!

00:24:38.880 --> 00:24:41.920
Oh, you found out about that already.

00:24:41.920 --> 00:24:42.820
Keiichi-san...

00:24:43.800 --> 00:24:45.550
Even after going through this,

00:24:45.550 --> 00:24:48.310
you still don't think that I'm a bother?

00:24:48.670 --> 00:24:50.660
Not at all!

00:24:50.660 --> 00:24:54.200
When you consider the good fortune that brought a goddess to me,

00:24:54.200 --> 00:24:56.210
what's one or two things like this?

00:24:57.460 --> 00:24:59.580
I'm so glad.

00:25:02.690 --> 00:25:03.890
I'm sorry...

00:25:03.890 --> 00:25:04.940
about Sayoko-

00:25:04.940 --> 00:25:05.690
It's OK.

00:25:05.950 --> 00:25:08.340
Please, don't say anything.

00:25:20.110 --> 00:25:22.340
What a hot couple!

00:25:22.860 --> 00:25:24.830
Well, then...

00:25:24.830 --> 00:25:26.300
maybe I should get going.

00:25:35.620 --> 00:25:36.770
Nee-san!

00:25:36.770 --> 00:25:37.830
What happened?

00:25:38.620 --> 00:25:40.250
It's from God!

00:25:40.810 --> 00:25:45.420
It is evident that our Ultimate Force System crashed

00:25:45.420 --> 00:25:47.220
due to your tampering.

00:25:47.220 --> 00:25:50.490
Until further notice, you are forbidden to return home.

00:25:50.490 --> 00:25:51.690
So it is written.

00:25:51.690 --> 00:25:53.490
Which means...

00:25:53.490 --> 00:25:56.150
She's probably going to be staying with us...

00:25:57.160 --> 00:25:59.900
I knew it!

00:25:59.900 --> 00:26:02.090
If it's a problem, then...

00:26:03.140 --> 00:26:05.000
With two goddesses and all,

00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:07.040
I'll be twice as happy!

00:26:07.040 --> 00:26:08.600
I'm sorry for the trouble.

00:26:08.600 --> 00:26:09.660
Good!

00:26:09.660 --> 00:26:12.780
Well then, that's settled.

00:26:12.780 --> 00:26:14.620
Yes, ma'am.

00:26:44.230 --> 00:26:49.720
ude wo kunda hishochi no sanpo de

00:26:44.230 --> 00:26:49.720
Taking a stroll at a summer resort, arm in arm,

00:26:49.730 --> 00:26:55.230
guuzen deau CHAPERU no wedding

00:26:49.730 --> 00:26:55.230
we happened to come across a wedding at a chapel.

00:26:55.240 --> 00:27:00.700
asa no kaze ni tokekomu sanbika

00:26:55.240 --> 00:27:00.700
Gospels melting in the morning breeze...

00:27:00.710 --> 00:27:05.640
shiawase sou na futari

00:27:00.710 --> 00:27:05.640
A happy looking couple...

00:27:06.050 --> 00:27:08.670
omedetou! omedetou

00:27:06.050 --> 00:27:08.510
"Congratulations!"

00:27:08.520 --> 00:27:11.410
"Thank you!"

00:27:08.660 --> 00:27:11.410
arigatou! arigatou

00:27:11.420 --> 00:27:17.160
shiroi BU-KE wo sashidasu shinpu

00:27:11.420 --> 00:27:17.110
The bride tosses her white bouquet.

00:27:17.120 --> 00:27:23.750
shiawase shiawase 
 wakete ageru

00:27:17.120 --> 00:27:23.750
I will share my happiness with you.

00:27:23.760 --> 00:27:28.690
tonari de hohoemu kare

00:27:23.760 --> 00:27:28.690
The groom smiling next to her.

00:27:28.700 --> 00:27:33.960
futari noseta kuruma ga ugoku to

00:27:28.700 --> 00:27:33.960
When the car carrying the couple starts to move,

00:27:33.970 --> 00:27:39.600
anata ooki na akubi hitotsu

00:27:33.970 --> 00:27:39.600
you let out a big yawn.

00:27:39.610 --> 00:27:45.080
GYUTto ude wo tsunette ageta no

00:27:39.610 --> 00:27:45.080
I pinch your arm...

00:27:45.090 --> 00:27:51.310
omoi ni kidzuku kashira

00:27:45.090 --> 00:27:51.310
I wonder if you even realize how I feel?

00:28:11.900 --> 00:28:13.040
The Third Episode is

00:28:13.040 --> 00:28:16.770
about one brave girl, Skuld, who
 fights the bugs whose outbreak

00:28:16.770 --> 00:28:21.040
was caused by Urd, who descended to
 Earth pretending she's a Cupid of Love!

00:28:21.040 --> 00:28:22.200
Oh Onee-sama!

00:28:22.550 --> 00:28:24.550
You shouldn't be in a place like this!

00:28:24.550 --> 00:28:27.300
I'll fix it so you can go back to the Heavens!

00:28:27.300 --> 00:28:30.850
Why don't you just admit that you're lonely?
